  - key: BUTTON_FREE_SPIN_START
    value: START
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_NAME_WILD
    value: <style=title><size=32>Wild Symbol</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_WILD
    value: "<size=18>\n- Wild symbol appears on reels 2, 3, and 4 only.\n\n- Wild
      may substitute for all symbols except \n   Goblin symbol.\n\n- If Wild appears
      in full stacks during Free \n   Games, it may be upgraded by a multiplier of
      \n   up to 5x."
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_WEAPON
    value: "<size=20>\n- User may select one of three weapons at any given time:
      axe, shield, arrow.\r\n- The selected weapon will be used to fight the Goblin
      when the Goblin feature is triggered. \r\n- Relative weapon strength is as
      follows."
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_PAYOUT_FORMAT
    value: '<b><size=24>5 <style=coinColor>{2:CommaNumber}</style>

      4 <style=coinColor>{1:CommaNumber}</style>

      3
      <style=coinColor>{0:CommaNumber}</style></size></b>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_2_WEAPON
    value: <style=title><size=32>Weapon Select Feature</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_2_STAGE
    value: <style=title><size=32>Dungeon Stages</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_3_GOBLIN
    value: <style=title><size=32>Goblin Symbol</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_3_GOBLIN_FEATURE
    value: <style=title><size=32>Goblin Feature</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_4_FREE_GAMES
    value: <style=title><size=32>Free Games</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_5_CHEST_BONUS
    value: <style=title><size=32>Sub-Symbols & Chest Bonus</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_LINES
    value: <style=title><size=42>Lines</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_2_WEAPON
    value: "<size=20>\n- User may select one of three weapons \n   at any given time:
      axe, shield, arrow.\r\n   \n- The selected weapon will be used to  \n   fight
      the Goblin when the Goblin \n   feature is triggered. \n\n- Relative weapon
      strength is as follows."
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_2_STAGE
    value: "<size=20>\n- There are 3 dungeon stages in the game.\r\n\n- User begins
      from stage 1 and moves up or down the stages \n   by fighting the Goblin in
      the Goblin feature.\r\n\n- The higher the stage, the more bonuses activated
      that may\n   be triggered."
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_3_GOBLIN
    value: "<size=20>\n- Goblin symbol appears in reels 2, 3, and 4.\r\n   \n- Goblin
      feature is triggered when the Goblin \n   symbol fills up the three center
      \n   reels."
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_3_GOBLIN_FEATURE
    value: "<size=20>\n- User will fight the Goblin with his or her weapon of choice\n  
      at the given time.\n\n- User's weapon strength relative to Goblin's weapon
      will\n   determine a win, draw, or loss.\n\n- Depending on the result, a reward
      or penalty will be \n   given as follows."
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_4_FREE_GAMES
    value: "<size=20>\n- Free Games may be triggered in stage 2 or above when the\n  
      user beats the Goblin.\n\n- During Free Games, if Wild symbol appears in a
      full stack\n   on any reel, award a random Wild multiplier (2x, 3x, 5x) \n  
      to that reel.\n\n- The Goblin symbol is removed during Free Games."
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_5_CHEST_BONUS
    value: "<size=20>\n- Sub-symbol appears on random symbols in stage\n   3 only.\r\n\n-
      All sub-symbols  are collected towards the Chest\n   Bonus meter.\r\n\n- When
      enough sub-symbols are collected, the Chest\n   Bonus is triggered. \r\n\n-
      When triggered, chest or additional free spin \n   symbols appear.\r\n\n- Chest
      symbols award credit, mini, minor, major or\n   grand jackpot."
  - key: PAYTABLE_WAY_INFO
    value: <size=24><color=#00eaff>50 LINES</color></size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_BET_INFO
    value: '<size=24><color=#00eaff>Bet Per Line: 1</color></size>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_01_01
    value: <style=title><size=32>BINGO</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_01_01
    value: '<size=17>-  1 to 5 Bingo symbols may appear on any position in the bottom
      5x5 matrix except the center spot.


      -  Each Bingo symbol landing on
      a position in the bottom 5x5 matrix, adds its value onto the corresponding
      position on the top 5x5 Bingo Card.'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_01_02
    value: <style=title><size=32>SCATTER</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_01_02
    value: '<b><size=24>5 <style=coinColor>20 x Total bet</style>

      4 <style=coinColor>10
      x Total bet</style>

      3 <style=coinColor>2 x Total bet</style></size></b>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_01_03
    value: <size=17>3 or more Scatters triggers Free Games.
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_01_03
    value: <style=title><size=32>WILD</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_01_04
    value: <size=17>Wild substitutes for all symbols except Bingo and Scatter symbols.
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_02_01
    value: <style=title><size=32>EXTRA BET</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_02_01
    value: '<size=21>-  50% of Line Bet is added as Extra Bet to enable Features.

'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_02_02
    value: <style=title><size=32>FREE GAMES</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_02_02
    value: "<size=17>\n-  3 or more Scatters triggers Free Games. Number of free
      spins depends on the number of Scatters when Free Games is triggered. \n\n- 
      Free Games can be re-triggered during Free Games.\n\n-  During Free Games,
      Wild becomes           ,            ,            , or           .\n\n-  Each
      line win with           ,            ,            , or            is multiplied
      by 2, 3, 5, or 10 respectively."
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_03_01
    value: <style=title><size=32>BINGO FEATURE</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_03_01
    value: "<size=17>\n-  Bingo Feature is triggered when one or more Bingo Lines
      are completed on the Bingo Card.\n\n-  Progress of a Bingo Card is saved per
      bet level.\n\n-  If one or more filled Bingo lines include Wheel symbol, one
      spin of Wheel Bonus is awarded.\n\n     -  During Wheel Bonus, the Wheel Bonus
      prize can be Credit, Mini Jackpot,\n        Minor Jackpot, Major Jackpot, Mega
      Jackpot, or Grand Jackpot.\n     \n     -  Range of Credit Prizes can be from
      at least 8x Total Bet up to \n        60x Total Bet during Wheel Bonus.\n    
      \n     -  The Wheel Bonus prize will replace the Wheel symbol and will be used
      \n        when Bingo prize is calculated.\n\n-  At the end of the Bingo Feature,
      for each filled Bingo line, all prizes are added and awarded.\n\n     -  If
      the same Progressive Jackpot is added multiple times, progressive amount is
      awarded only once.\n\n-  Bingo Card resets after the completion of Bingo Feature.\n\n- 
      When Bingo Card is reset, 2 to 3 random positions on the Bingo Card are filled
      with Mini Jackpots, Minor Jackpots, or Major Jackpots."
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_04_01
    value: <style=title><size=32>MAGIC HANDS FEATURE 1</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_04_01
    value: '<size=17>

      -  After any spin which does not trigger the Bingo Feature,             
      may randomly add credit prizes to any 2 or 3 positions, filled or unfilled,
      on the Bingo Card.

      -  This feature cannot be triggered with Magic Hands
      Feature 2 during the same spin.'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_04_02
    value: <style=title><size=32>MAGIC HANDS FEATURE 2</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_04_02
    value: "<size=17>\n-  After any spin which does not trigger the Bingo Feature,             
      may randomly add a Special prize to 1 unfilled position on the Bingo Card.\n- 
      This Special prize stays for 3 spins.\n-  When a Bingo symbol lands on the
      Special prize, Super Bingo Feature is triggered. \n-  This feature cannot be
      triggered with Magic Hands Feature 1 during the same spin."
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_05_01
    value: <style=title><size=32>SUPER BINGO FEATURE</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_05_01
    value: "<size=17>\n-  Super Bingo Feature is triggered when a              lands
      on                that is added by the Magic Hands Feature 2.\n-  When Super
      Bingo Feature is triggered, one spin of Wheel Bonus is awarded.\n     -  During
      Wheel Bonus, the Wheel Bonus prize can be Credit, Mini \n        Jackpot, Minor
      Jackpot, Major Jackpot, Mega Jackpot, or Grand Jackpot.\n     -  Range of Credit
      Prizes can be from at least 8x Total Bet up to \n        60x Total Bet during
      Wheel Bonus.\n     -  The Wheel Bonus prize will replace the Wheel symbol and
      will \n        be used to calculate Super Bingo prizes.\n-  At the end of the
      Super Bingo Feature, all prizes are added and awarded regardless of Bingo Lines.\n- 
      Bingo Card resets after the completion of Super Bingo Feature.\n-  When Bingo
      Card is reset, 2 to 3 random positions on the Bingo Card are filled with Mini
      Jackpots, Minor Jackpots, or Major Jackpots."
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_LINES
    value: <style=title><size=27>LINES
